%% DB Hive - Sequence diagram: Run Query Flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as AppAPI
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant OBJ as ObjectStorage

  U->>FE: Click Run
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/queries/run {visual_spec, params}
  API-->>FE: 202 Accepted {jobId}
  API->>W: enqueue job {jobId, querySpec}
  W->>DB: persist QueryExecution - started
  W->>DB: stream partial results or write to ObjectStorage for large output
  W-->>API: job progress updates
  API-->>FE: job progress (poll/SSE/websocket)
  W->>DB: finalize QueryExecution - completed
  W->>OBJ: upload large result file
  API-->>FE: 200 OK {resultSummary, downloadUrl}
